### Send message from user1 to user2
POST https://localhost:3000/chat/send-message
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

{
    "receiverId": 2,
    "content": "Hello! How are you?"
}

### Send message from user2 to user1
POST https://localhost:3000/chat/send-message
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_SECOND_TOKEN_HERE

{
    "receiverId": 1,
    "content": "Hi! I'm doing great, thanks!"
}

### Send another message from user1 to user2
POST https://localhost:3000/chat/send-message
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

{
    "receiverId": 2,
    "content": "That's awesome! Want to play a game?"
}

### Get messages between user1 and user2 (as user1)
GET https://localhost:3000/chat/get-messages/2
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Get messages between user1 and user2 (as user2)
GET https://localhost:3000/chat/get-messages/1
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_SECOND_TOKEN_HERE

### Send message with empty content (should fail)
POST https://localhost:3000/chat/send-message
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

{
    "receiverId": 2,
    "content": ""
}

### Send message without content (should fail)
POST https://localhost:3000/chat/send-message
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

{
    "receiverId": 2
}

### Send message without receiverId (should fail)
POST https://localhost:3000/chat/send-message
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

{
    "content": "Hello!"
}

### Get messages with invalid user ID (should fail)
GET https://localhost:3000/chat/get-messages/999
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
